        "title": "Token-type dict rebuilt on every tag token in hot lexer path",
        "explanation": "create_token runs once per tag token for every template compile. The new code builds a three-entry dict on each call, where the old code did a direct comparison. The extra allocation is small but sits on a hot path, and the surrounding comments show this code is tuned for performance (for example, the hard-coded 2s).",
